# Vercel / Vite Frontend Environment
#
# Build-time variables are inlined by Vite during `npm run build`.
# After deploying the backend on Render, paste the public base URL here:
#   Example (Render): https://testimonial-api-abc12.onrender.com/api/v1
#   Example (local):  http://localhost:5000/api/v1
#
# Vercel project → Settings → Environment Variables → add VITE_API_BASE_URL
# (Requires a new Vercel deploy to pick up the new env var)

VITE_API_BASE_URL=
